&lt;div class=&quot;callout&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This guide assists area-based tenure holders such as Tree Farm Licences (TFL), Community Forest Agreements (CFA) and First Nations Woodland Licences (FNWL) prepare the information package and timber supply analysis report, which are the major components of a management plan:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/assets/gov/farming-natural-resources-and-industry/forestry/stewardship/forest-analysis-inventory/tsr-annual-allowable-cut/guide_area_based_tenures.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Provincial Guide for the preparation of Information Packages and Analysis Reports for Area-based Tenures (PDF, 2MB)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;callout&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn about the methodology, assumptions and parameters&amp;nbsp;used in forest carbon modelling for Timber Supply Review:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/assets/gov/farming-natural-resources-and-industry/forestry/stewardship/forest-analysis-inventory/tsr-annual-allowable-cut/tsr_carbon_modeling_guidance_25_april_2025.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Carbon Modelling Guidance for Timber Supply Review (PDF, 847KB)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Learn about the&amp;nbsp;estimation, accounting and reporting of climate change mitigation from investments in silviculture on public land:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/assets/gov/farming-natural-resources-and-industry/forestry/stewardship/forest-analysis-inventory/tsr-annual-allowable-cut/climate_change_mitigation_silviculture.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Quantification Methodology Climate Change Mitigation from Silviculture Investments (PDF, 1.1MB)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;bc_h2&quot;&gt;Timber Supply Review special reports&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/assets/gov/farming-natural-resources-and-industry/forestry/stewardship/forest-analysis-inventory/tsr-annual-allowable-cut/climate_change_in_tsr_report_april_6_2023_no_ip.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Climate change in TSR Report April 6 2023 (PDF, 2.78MB)&lt;/a&gt; a discussion paper assisting in climate change consideration into the Timber Supply Review (TSR) process.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Periodically, forest analysis staff will do analysis or modelling in light of changing forest conditions:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/assets/gov/farming-natural-resources-and-industry/forestry/stewardship/forest-analysis-inventory/impacts_2024_fires.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Impacts of 2024 Fires on Forests and Timber Supply in British Columbia (PDF, 1.23MB)&lt;/a&gt; an assessment of the effect of the 2024 wildfires on timber supply&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/assets/gov/farming-natural-resources-and-industry/forestry/stewardship/forest-analysis-inventory/tsr-annual-allowable-cut/wildfire_report_2023v1.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Impacts of 2023 Fires on Forests and Timber Supply in British Columbia (PDF, 1.2MB)&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;an assessment of&amp;nbsp;the effect of the 2023 wildfires on timber supply&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/assets/gov/farming-natural-resources-and-industry/forestry/stewardship/forest-analysis-inventory/tsr-annual-allowable-cut/impacts_of_2021_fires_final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Impacts of 2021 Fires on Forests and Timber Supply in British Columbia (PDF, 964KB)&lt;/a&gt; assesses the effect of the 2021 wildfires on timber supply&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/assets/gov/farming-natural-resources-and-industry/forestry/stewardship/forest-analysis-inventory/impacts_of_2018_fires.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Impacts of 2018 Fires on Timber Supply (PDF, 932KB)&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;provides an impact analysis of the 2018 wildfires on timber supply&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/assets/gov/farming-natural-resources-and-industry/forestry/stewardship/forest-analysis-inventory/impacts_2017_fires.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Impacts of 2017 Fires on Timber Supply (PDF, 1MB)&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;provides an impact analysis of the 2017 wildfires on timber supply in the 100 Mile House, Quesnel and Williams Lake timber supply areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt
